NOTICE

The code, policies and write-up in this repository are ScopeBlind's, under the
MIT licence in LICENSE. The repository also contains material derived from two
benchmarks, both under the MIT licence. Their notices are quoted below as they
appear in each project's LICENSE file at the commit used.

No benchmark file is re-hosted here. What is included is derived output of
our replays: gate decisions, trace and ground-truth indexes, owner lists
written into the policies, and signed samples and run records for a subset of
runs, which carry the call arguments, facts and replayed tool results that the
receipts bind. The reports quote short excerpts where a listing needs them.
Fetch the benchmarks themselves from their own repositories.

